Register the OpenAI /v1/decisions handler for classify-task read strategies.
The d3 family resolves to D3Strategy (task "classify"); upstream only wires
the OpenAI dialect for task "generate", returning 501 for d3 even though
OpenAIServingDecisions drives the same strategy.read() interface systemone
uses. Minimal gate widening; drop when upstream lands classify support.
--- a/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm/entrypoints/openai/decisions/state.py
+++ b/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm/entrypoints/openai/decisions/state.py
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@
     except ValueError:
         return None
 
-    if strategy.task == "generate":
+    if strategy.task in ("generate", "classify"):
         state.openai_serving_decisions = OpenAIServingDecisions(
             state.openai_serving_models,
             strategy,
